{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_068_title", "source_sha256": "399ad2eebea9e09f155889132587b60d6057e091cb15b76993b0fbced9d65c6b", "ja": "今も、まだ……", "zh": "现在也、依然……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_068_synopsis", "source_sha256": "edfc34f5671951358643d174e51d9ed20038a8e81e80ec345cb1b2a427c75e32", "ja": "ライブツアーの最後を劇場公演で飾ることに\nなった春香。朋花とまつりから学びつつ、\n準備を進めた。そして未来の「もっとアイ\nドルになりたい！」という言葉が、春香の\nステージへの新たな夢をふくらませる。", "zh": "巡回巡演的最后一站定在剧场公演，\n春香一边向朋花与茉莉请教，\n一边推进着准备工作。此时未来的一句\n“我想成为更好的偶像！”，\n让春香对舞台的新梦想越发膨胀开来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_068_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d2dd81395a7c58f5766b704c686c5f65603aa477d81bd15f6e2d63ca20c25a10", "ja": "（ソロ曲が終わり、春香のMCが始まる。その表情は、\n舞台袖から見てもはっきりわかるほど輝いている……）", "zh": "个人曲结束后，春香的MC开始了。从舞台侧面也能清楚看到，她的表情闪耀着光芒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_068_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "9cf99548f8f94492942567afa32a0e86e1a2ff87133a7d6b109790a1eda9d593", "ja": "みんな、ありがとーっ！\n今日はまだまだ、楽しんでいってねーっ！", "zh": "大家，谢谢你们——！\n今天还要继续尽情享受哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_068_1002_null", "source_sha256": "2f1c28175fe34940119553d3c5ce8ecce907f5a468b1ec05ff513fbbab212bf9", "ja": "ワアアアァァァーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_068_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "790c9c4d162a72f1ffa0a0e8049a5ab206c74e78619c1c9dc1093ab8b1c794cd", "ja": "本当のことを言うと、私……初めて大きな会場の\nステージに立った時は、夢中で何も見えなかったんだ。", "zh": "说真的，我……第一次站上大场馆的舞台时，完全沉浸其中，什么都看不见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_068_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "b248ca179528e90eba977b8aeb82bef6a7912f3a329e1b3d8645c50b9566cecc", "ja": "でも、今は……\n一番後ろの席まで、ちゃんと見えてるよ！！", "zh": "可是现在……\n连最后一排的座位，我都能清清楚楚地看见哦！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_068_1005_null", "source_sha256": "288637574b453b6245189e1e908d01633a96d2b65866303c395aeebf94d2bce6", "ja": "ワアアアアアァァァァァーッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_068_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "68794624393dc226983750c57a627430bf4570b13badbd1306736ea594e4d7a4", "ja": "春香さんは、子豚ちゃんひとりひとりの様子まで、\n本当によく見ているんですね～。", "zh": "春香小姐对每一只小猪仔的状态都观察得那么仔细，真的很厉害呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_068_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "222212ce2df61ae2b7e5c798da800176f89b1d5c58b9f75b265649463555d4e6", "ja": "未来ちゃんも、こっちに来て見てみるといいのです。\n春香ちゃんとお客さんが、よく見えるのですよ。", "zh": "未来也过来这边看看吧。\n能很清楚地看到春香和观众哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_068_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "02296b3dbf25c43cb03c6957ed0614d2fb08390ec7b8d32aec962ddf749fa2d1", "ja": "わ～、本当！　遠くの客席まで、\nすっごくよく見えるよ、まつりちゃん、朋花ちゃん！", "zh": "哇～，真的耶！就连好远的观众席\n都能看得超级清楚呢，茉莉、朋花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_068_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "a9bbb93b3cd983887bf90afc164decb3f90764d35157b8f85fe6efd286314466", "ja": "でも不思議だな～。ステージに立ってる時と、こうして\n舞台袖にいる時だと、何だか違って見えるような……？", "zh": "不过真奇怪啊～站在舞台上时，和像这样待在台侧时，总觉得看起来好像不太一样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_068_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "728b0770960f417f6bf0d17838ad9780edfeac156024aae93eded44e666ba4d8", "ja": "そうね。……ステージに立っている時の気持ちは、\nその時、その人にしか、味わえないものかも。", "zh": "是啊。……站在舞台上的心情，或许是只有那时、只有那个人才能体会到的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_068_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "d9c3d81b6b4d90b0a14fe2765b829d0dd06c0a6ad4d213383e7b12084a7408dd", "ja": "その時、その人にしか……かぁ……。\n春香さんは、今どんな景色を見てるのかな……。", "zh": "只有在那个时候、只有那个人才能体会到吗……是这样啊……\n春香前辈现在看到的，会是怎样的景色呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_068_1012_se", "source_sha256": "5bc69e5b1c1ad7ceead171d240a9d31173ed372760ba22fbc0b5aa7947d8d15c", "ja": "パチパチパチパチ……", "zh": "啪啪啪啪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_068_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9cac339fe77eb3b90e42b0946f08fcb36ae5cc7b9dca1b4d379a67e3c1885c1a", "ja": "（鳴り止まない拍手の中、春香が舞台袖に駆けてくる。\nこうして、春香の劇場センター公演は終わった……）", "zh": "（在经久不息的掌声中，春香从舞台侧边跑了过来。\n就这样，春香的剧场中心公演结束了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_068_1014_p", "source_sha256": "fb8d9640f931a13cebc70fa14557a2f79bc7de3bc81366bd0a511054cfc38fd5", "ja": "（センター公演は終わっても、春香のアイドル活動は\n終わらない。もっと、もっと……その先を目指して！）", "zh": "即使中心公演结束了，春香的偶像活动也不会结束。要更加、更加……向着更远的地方前进！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
